  "heading": "\\rationals",
  "heading_latex": "\\textrm{the rationals}\\quad\\htmlClass{mlg-title-written}{\\mathbb{Q}}",
  "body_text": null,
  "page": null,
  "source": "[\\rationals]\nDefines: Qb ::= (Q, 0, 1, +, *, neg(q_), inv(q_), leq(a_, b_))\nabstractly:\nspecifies:\n. Q is \\set\n. 0 \"in\" Q\n. 1 \"in\" Q\n. + is \\binary.operation:on{Q}\n. * is \\binary.operation:on{Q}\n. neg is \\function:on{Q}:to{Q}\n. inv is \\function:on{Q}:to{Q}\n. leq is \\total.order:on{Q}\nexpresses:\n. 0 != 1\n. inv(0) = 0\n. forAll: a, b, c \"in\" Q\n  then:\n  . (a + b) + c = a + (b + c)\n  . a + b = b + a\n  . a + 0 = a\n  . a + neg(a) = 0\n  . (a * b) * c = a * (b * c)\n  . a * b = b * a\n  . a * 1 = a\n  . a * (b + c) = (a * b) + (a * c)\n  . if: a != 0\n    then: a * inv(a) = 1\n  . if: leq(a, b)\n    then: leq(a + c, b + c)\n. forAll: a, b \"in\" Q\n  where:\n  . leq(0, a)\n  . leq(0, b)\n  then: leq(0, a * b)\nEnables:\n. capability: q_ \"in\" Qb :-> q_ is \\rational\n. view:\n  as: S := Q is \\set\nDocumented:\n. called: \"the rationals\"\n. written: \"\\mathbb{Q}\"\n. description: \"The rational numbers as an abstract ordered-field tuple\n                $(Q,0,1,+,\\cdot,-,(\\cdot)^{-1},\\leq)$.\"\nId: \"8454e27c-2e90-4944-a36b-27b66be5f4cf\"",
